+  "All amounts are 1978 dollars. The benchmark is the NSW experimental treated-minus-control contrast.",
+  "",
+  "| Estimator | Covariates | Support | Estimate | 95% CI | Benchmark | Gap | Treated N | Control N | Control ESS |",
+  "|---|---|---|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|"
+)
